			<td style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: top; width: 68.9%; border-left: 1px solid black;">
			<p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 36pt; text-align: justify;">2. The period beginning on the date which is sixty-one (61) days&nbsp;following the Issue Date and ending on the date which is one hundred twenty (120) days following the Issue Date.</p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: top; width: 18.2%; border-left: 1px solid black; border-right: 1px solid black;">
			<p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: center;">120%</p>
			</td>
		</tr>
